  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1003.07 Designated Rivers. No facility shall be sited in violation of RSA 483, relative to protection of designated rivers.\n\nSource. #6894-B, eff 12-1-98; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1000); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2703.07); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13864, eff 2-6-24",
